{{also|goto|göto|go to|go-to}}
==English==
{{wikipedia|Goto (command)}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|go to}}; a keyword in many programming languages including BASIC and C.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} Any construct which produces an unstructured [[jump]] in the flow of execution.
#: ''The setjmp/longjmp facility in C is essentially a '''GOTO'''.''

